     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "Biased algorithms can result in discriminatory outcomes, leading to unjust treatment and potential legal consequences. Regular monitoring and testing can help identify and address any bias before it causes harm."
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "To ensure models are not overfitting"
    }
